Here are the relevant line of my .slashemrc (I hope they're all here...)
OPTIONS=windowtype:x11,tiles:x11

TILESET=name:x11,file:x11tiles
TILESET=name:x11big,file:x11bigtiles


You should have files named 'x11tiles', 'x11bigtiles' in your slash'em  
directory (/usr/local/slashemdir, /usr/share/games/slashem or whatever you  
said at compiletime).
Maybe these files have another name on your computer and finding the right  
names can be useful...

You can also try some other frontend. I remeber using a frontend (IIRC,  
the debian package 'slashem-sdl') which as a list of all tileset when  
accessed by the 'O'ption menu.


